silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_12_orientation_closure_album_sections_05_reader_handoff_concrete_anchor_1#mittensapex silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensApex is the named running anchor cat (the colim apex of D_Mittens). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
